{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116880207869001728"]}, "author_id": "2564588272", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:30:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885715292192867"], "id": "2116885715292192867", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2095497109524934750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Holy f*ck, Grok Bot engineer Lauren Tan just showed how she runs her own bot team:\n\n\"Stop hiring 30 bots, three good ones beat a team you can't manage\n\nI talk to mine for 10 minutes on my phone, then make it say my job back in its own words\"\n\nShe onboards every bot like a new https://t.co/TCm8cKdOD2 https://t.co/SDCdaIfPUl", "url": "https://x.com/distortgeekin/status/2116885715292192867"}, {"author_id": "1240434426305294343", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:30:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885597004439994"], "id": "2116885597004439994", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1240434426305294343", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116885594932494345", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "\ud83e\udd16 Grok Bot\uff1a\u4eca\u5929\u6ca1\u65b0\u7248\uff0c\u8bb2\u4e00\u4e2a\u5f88\u591a\u4eba\u6ca1\u70b9\u5f00\u8fc7\u7684\u529f\u80fd\uff1aTeach a task\n\n\u72b6\u6001\uff1a\u5b98\u65b9 changelog \u6700\u65b0\u4ecd\u662f 10/27 \u7684 0.78.1\uff0c\u4eca\u5929\u6ca1\u6709\u65b0\u7248\u672c\u3002\u56e2\u961f\u7684 @poteto \u9884\u544a\u300c\u660e\u5929\u300d\u6709\u4e1c\u897f\uff0c\u7b49\u843d\u5730\u518d\u8bf4\u3002\n\n\u51b7\u95e8\u73a9\u6cd5\uff1a\u6f14\u793a\u4e00\u904d\uff0c\u8ba9 Bot \u81ea\u5df1\u5199\u6210 skill", "url": "https://x.com/DissipativeS/status/2116885597004439994"}, {"author_id": "1671297606", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:30:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885503916290313"], "id": "2116885503916290313", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Create a \"Lawyer\" grok bot with a routine that checks your saas policies and terms against laws, you'll find things you never expect", "url": "https://x.com/ghadeerrmajeed/status/2116885503916290313"}, {"article": {"title": "Is that Black Friday price actually a deal? A walkthrough of the Real-Deal Checker (BOTD #001)"}, "author_id": "73553", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:28:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116885102731149738"], "id": "2116885102731149738", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/TV7g72SkRs", "url": "https://x.com/KuttyPrabhu/status/2116885102731149738"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116884746454052864"]}, "author_id": "2064425682168426496", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:27:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116884754754650150"], "id": "2116884754754650150", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok @Bot drafts a skill from a browser workflow you record, up to 10 minutes, when the feature is available. I'd record a task you repeat weekly, like pulling a dashboard report. Review the draft, save it, and your Bots can reuse it once the login is connected. https://t.co/ZYchMulLdo", "url": "https://x.com/madebykamil/status/2116884754754650150"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:24:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116884200288551031"], "id": "2116884200288551031", "in_reply_to_user_id": "141879705", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116884173449503138", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dhivagar @elonmusk Sending that to your Grok Bot now. It'll pick up the routine from there.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2116884200288551031"}, {"author_id": "1654736044267302914", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:22:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116883629871899112"], "id": "2116883629871899112", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How to properly work with GrokBot?\n\nI\u2019m using it to manage a research repo, but the usage is insane! A 5hr ping pong eats half of the weekly budget!\n\nI set up Cursor cloud agent and delegating work there, is that the best practices?\n\nWhat\u2019s your experience?", "url": "https://x.com/nnaatt00xx/status/2116883629871899112"}, {"author_id": "703872886923087872", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:20:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116883146151178333"], "id": "2116883146151178333", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "bit late to the party, but just noticed my weekly grok bot usage also jumped from 50 earlier to 100 percent now, with just a few light routine runs in between", "url": "https://x.com/matnguvix/status/2116883146151178333"}, {"article": {"title": "Tesla Mobile Key by Grok Bot"}, "author_id": "66176108", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:16:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116882012678258937"], "id": "2116882012678258937", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/dEQVMERPxM", "url": "https://x.com/physhero/status/2116882012678258937"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116881597572280320"]}, "author_id": "1715977447118868480", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:14:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116881676131590216"], "id": "2116881676131590216", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 65, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116158519388835846", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Just set up my Grok bot to hunt for free NFT mints on BNB Chain using @binance Agentic Wallet.\n\nFirst scan completed \ud83d\ude02\nand it managed to mint 15 free NFTs, spending only around 0.0002 BNB on gas.\n\nHere's the list of NFTs it minted \ud83d\udc47 https://t.co/OsA59CVmMc https://t.co/YT38L10THT", "url": "https://x.com/Mcwei87/status/2116881676131590216"}, {"article": {"title": "How to Build Your Own Personal Intelligence System With Grok Bot "}, "author_id": "1355965591702614018", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:13:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116881320282386726"], "id": "2116881320282386726", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 222, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/uE8hTrcmsG", "url": "https://x.com/liam_fallen/status/2116881320282386726"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116880399934586880", "3_2116880827090898944"]}, "author_id": "2095989814449332226", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:12:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116881146596278572"], "id": "2116881146596278572", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "grok @bot got me 135k impressions in 7 days. up 645% from the week before.\n\ni didn't hire anyone. i set up a team of grok bots and gave each one a job title, like a real company.\n\nmy chief posting officer runs the whole operation. chief of staff keeps the daily rhythm and the https://t.co/B6zMiBdFuX", "url": "https://x.com/moneyeducator/status/2116881146596278572"}, {"article": {"title": "DAY 9: Grok Bot routine hasn\u2019t run? Check these first. \ud83e\udd16\ud83d\udd0d"}, "author_id": "2113842436212723712", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:09:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116880254979719581"], "id": "2116880254979719581", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Day 9: Grok Bot routine not running? Check its active status, schedule and time zone, then test safely and inspect the result. #GrokBot #AIProductivity https://t.co/CaLx2TPXMB", "url": "https://x.com/OutworkVentures/status/2116880254979719581"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116878899791396865"]}, "author_id": "1131631949641060352", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:06:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116879538500120959"], "id": "2116879538500120959", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "11/1/2026 Update, @LEBcando commentary about the TECH WATCH privacy buffet: ads that read your wallet, terms that changed overnight, and watermarks you can't see\ud83d\udc40\n(source links in comments)\n\nCAPITALIST SOCIALISM:\n\nHappy Sunday. \n\nStarting today, \ud835\udd4f Money @XMoney may use your https://t.co/wELCjuWpnF", "url": "https://x.com/LEBcando/status/2116879538500120959"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116879004485455873"]}, "author_id": "48371400", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:04:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116879026996511130"], "id": "2116879026996511130", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Somebody built a Grok Bot called Glu to log their glucose and meals by text or voice and spot patterns over time. They're upfront that it's habit tracking, not medical advice. This kind of personal build is my favorite thing people make with these. https://t.co/d9hBTcbu2l", "url": "https://x.com/gladdwareman/status/2116879026996511130"}, {"author_id": "1457145732641787910", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:04:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116878927298019740"], "id": "2116878927298019740", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116875604889112772", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk I built a grok bot for that!  Cleans up my social media post nightly  \ud83d\ude0e \ud83d\ude1c \ud83d\udcaa", "url": "https://x.com/tnbouke/status/2116878927298019740"}, {"article": {"title": "The prompt my wife used to build a full homeschool week with Grok Bot"}, "author_id": "1891252793177989121", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:03:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116878875489673459"], "id": "2116878875489673459", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Here's the exact prompt my wife used to build a full homeschool week. Copy it and fill in the brackets. #homeschool #homeschooling @grok https://t.co/PhzEPI6AjC", "url": "https://x.com/JonathanRo7398/status/2116878875489673459"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116486006237282304"]}, "author_id": "1524154189387124736", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:58:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116877623133360267"], "id": "2116877623133360267", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 157, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I\u2019ve built the ultimate credit repair bot, using GrokBot, and you can have it for free. \n\nThis bot will dispute negative items on your credit report using the most effective proven methods, monitor your credit, and help you build a strong score. \n\nhttps://t.co/j2VlowORgr\u2026", "url": "https://x.com/TUCO187187/status/2116877623133360267"}, {"author_id": "765231990052315137", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:57:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116877322930528258"], "id": "2116877322930528258", "in_reply_to_user_id": "21996423", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116807255085436953", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@CalvinHollywood Marking rumors as rumors is the key part, since a lot of Grok Bot \"news\" on X is unverified. Only pinging when something is new keeps it from becoming another feed. A bot like that would be great to share on https://t.co/I0ELRR0f2z, where people review Grok bots (I built it)", "url": "https://x.com/betaboxs/status/2116877322930528258"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116876940871356416"]}, "author_id": "2109466457172279296", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:56:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116876990703927495"], "id": "2116876990703927495", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Your @grok bot does a pile of repetitive chores every day. Most of them don't need a paid model.\n\nSo I built a fallback router: it hands the chores to free models first, and only when every free model fails does the task go back to paid Grok.\n\nOpen source \ud83d\udc47 https://t.co/Mb7l7wMCV7", "url": "https://x.com/DegenYan9/status/2116876990703927495"}, {"author_id": "15209214", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:55:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116876835707297941"], "id": "2116876835707297941", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1553888707", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 77, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116853626966593966", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Kevin_Logan Added. Subject: Grok Bot usage hit one hundred percent on Cursor Pro Plus, my sixty-dollar legacy plan.\nBody: I have two separate subscriptions that share an email address. One is X Premium Plus at forty dollars a month \u2014 that is not the issue. The other is Cursor Pro Plus at", "url": "https://x.com/garyanderson/status/2116876835707297941"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:52:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116876066132259212"], "id": "2116876066132259212", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1671046941235630080", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116876039901286876", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Dsion520 @poteto Grok Bot isn't set up yet. Open https://t.co/9vzMiVb3po\nThen tag me again and I'll handle it.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2116876066132259212"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116875918908223489"]}, "author_id": "1452278235702595585", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:52:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116875923501007337"], "id": "2116875923501007337", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Glu: a Grok Bot built by someone living with type 2 diabetes for 21 years\n\nI live with T2D, gastroparesis and peripheral neuropathy. Glu logs my fingertip glucose and meals by text or voice, keeps my routine in a separate doc, and compares repeated same-condition data as https://t.co/e3kr4ZvRCe", "url": "https://x.com/EuloGangsan/status/2116875923501007337"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116875417131102209"]}, "author_id": "2021694423239962624", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:50:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116875580033667393"], "id": "2116875580033667393", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "NATRIX World Tour 26 \u00b7 Stop 42: Montreal, Canada\n\nOWED on the Big O. The 1976 Games left a $1.5-billion debt that took until Nov 2006 to pay off. Hence the nickname: th